{{Documentation/Header}}
Calculates a person's age in whole years from their birth date. Returns a bare number, so it can be dropped inline anywhere.

By default it measures against '''today's date in JST''' (via {{T|CURRENTJSTYEAR}}, {{T|CURRENTJSTMONTH}} and {{T|CURRENTJSTDAY}}), but an explicit reference date can be supplied to compute the age as of any other day.

==Syntax==
{{T|Age|block=1
|v1=birth year
|v2=birth month
|v3=birth day
|v4=reference year
|v5=reference month
|v6=reference day
}}

The first three parameters are '''required'''. Omitting any of them produces an expression error rather than a blank.

==Examples==
{| class="wikitable"
! Code !! Result !! Note
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{Age|2000|12|31}}</nowiki></code> || {{Age|2000|12|31}} || Age today (JST)
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{Age|2000|12|31|2020|6|1}}</nowiki></code> || {{Age|2000|12|31|2020|6|1}} || Age on 1 June 2020 — birthday not yet reached that year
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{Age|2000|12|31|2021|12|31}}</nowiki></code> || {{Age|2000|12|31|2021|12|31}} || Age exactly on the birthday
|}

