==How it works==
The template subtracts the birth year from the reference year, then subtracts one more if the birthday has not yet occurred in that year:

: ''age'' = (''ref year'' − ''birth year'') − ( ''ref month'' < ''birth month'', '''or''' same month and ''ref day'' < ''birth day'' )

Two consequences worth knowing:
* '''Zero-padded values are fine.''' <code>06</code> is read as 6, so values from the JST templates can be passed straight through.
* '''No validation.''' A birth date in the future returns a negative number, and an impossible date such as <code>2</code>/<code>31</code> is not rejected.

==Used by==
{{T|Utaite}} and {{T|Youtaite}} (automatic age in the infobox) · {{T|Bd}} · {{T|BirthdayEntry}} · {{T|ProcessSingerPage/Birthday}}

